<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Eikon source</title>
<style>
  :root { color-scheme: light dark; }
  body { font: 16px/1.5 -apple-system, system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 40rem; margin: 3rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; }
  h1 { margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
  code { background: rgba(128,128,128,0.15); padding: 0.1rem 0.35rem; border-radius: 4px; }
  .add { display: inline-block; margin: 0.5rem 0; padding: 0.5rem 0.9rem; border-radius: 8px;
         background: #c6f54a; color: #111; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; }
  ul { padding-left: 1.2rem; }
  .muted { color: gray; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Eikon</h1>
<p>An early prototype that reports whether JIT is usable and shows device status.</p>

<h2>Add this source in Sileo</h2>
<p>URL: <code>@REPO_URL@</code></p>
<p><a class="add" href="sileo://source/@REPO_URL@">Add to Sileo</a></p>

<h2>Package</h2>
<p>Version @VERSION@, released @DATE@. For iOS 15.0 or later on Dopamine (rootless).</p>

<h2>Other install methods</h2>
<p class="muted">The TrollStore build (.tipa, needs Developer Mode on iOS 16+) and the AltStore build (.ipa) are on the GitHub release, not in this source.</p>

<h2>Links</h2>
<ul>
